mg, 50 μmol), sodium tri(benzoyloxy)borohydride 5f (0.16 g, 0.75 mmol),
and triethylamine (0.14 mL, 1.0 mmol) in dry NMP (0.5 mL) was heated to
70 °C for 16 h. After cooling to r.t., 5 mL of water was added to the
