$DATUM Potassium
3-(((1R,2S)-2,3-Dihydro-2-hydroxy-1H-inden-1-ylamino)methyl)furan-2-yl-trifluoroborate.
To a test tube containing 3-formylfuran-2-yltrifluoroborate (61mg, 0.30
mmol) in MeOH (3 mL) was added (1R,2S)-(+)-cis-1-amino-2-indanol (45 mg,
0.3 mmol) with stirring at room temperature for 2 h. To this solution was
added pyridineborane (27 mg, 0.3 mmol) and stirring was continued 16 h.
The solvent was then removed and the resulting white solid was extracted
with acetone (10 mL) using a Soxhlet extractor. To the acetone solution
was then added MeOH (2 mL) and KHF2 (94 mg, 1.21 mmol). After stirring
for 2 hours, the solvent was removed in vacuo and theresulting white
solid was extracted with 10% MeOH/acetone (3 x 5 mL). This solution was
concentrated and then precipitated with ether (10 mL) to give Potassium
3-(((1R,2S)-2,3-Dihydro-2-hydroxy-1H-inden-1-ylamino)methyl)furan-2-yl-trifluoroborate,
yield 79 mg, 97%. Mp: greater than 200 °C.; [α]22D -6.0° (c = 2.4,
acetone); IR (KBr) = 3523, 3171, 2918, 2358 cm-1; 1H NMR (500 MHz,
acetone-d6): δ 2.02 - 2.04 (m, 1H), 2.07 (s,1H), 2.94 (dd, J = 17, 3 Hz,
1H), 3.39 (d, J = 7 Hz, 1H), 4.08 (dd, J = 28, 13 Hz, 2H), 4.40 (d, J = 5
Hz, 1H), 4.61 - 4.64 (m, 1H), 6.32 (s, 1H), 7.14 - 7.27 (m, 3H), 7.33 (d,
J = 2 Hz, 1H), 7.46 (d, J = 8 Hz, 1 Hz); 13C NMR (125.8 MHz, acetone-d6):
δ 39.2, 43.0, 64.0, 70.2, 110.5, 120.4, 125.0, 125.1, 126.6, 128.4,
140.0, 141.4, 141.7; 19F NMR (471 MHz, acetone-d6): δ -139.8; 11B NMR
(128 MHz, acetone-d6): δ 0.14; HRMS (ESI): calcd for C14H14BF3NO2 [M-K]-
296.1070, found 296.1077.
