$DATUM Methyl
3',5'-bis((bis(pyridin-2-ylmethyl)amino)methyl)-[1,1'-biphenyl]-2-carboxylate
(iv, via procedure C). Methyl
3',5'-diformyl-[1,1'-biphenyl]-2-carboxylate (iii) (0.5 g, 1.88 mmol, 1
eq) and 2,2- dipicolylamine (0.786 g, 3.94 mmol, 2.1 eq) were dissolved
in anhydrous 1,2-DCE (20 mL) in the presence of 4 Å molecular sieves.
After 10 minutes of stirring, sodium triacetoxyborohydride (1.2 g, 5.64
mmol, 3 eq) was added in one portion. The solution was allowed to react
at room temperature for five hours or at 50°C for 20 minutes, after which
it was poured into saturated sodium bicarbonate solution and the product
was extracted several times into dichloromethane. Following drying and
concentration in vacuo, the product was purified by flash chromatography
(92% dichloromethane/7% methanol/1% NH4OH, gradient), to furnish iv.
Yield 0.99 g, 90 %. δH (400 MHz, CDCl3) 3.39 (s, 3H, -CO2CH3), 3.72 (s,
4H, -PhCH2N), 3.83 (s, 8H, -NCH2Pyr), 7.12 (m, 4H, CH (Ar)), 7.24 (s, 2H,
CH (Ar)), 7.33 (d, J= 7.8 Hz, 1H, CH (Ar)), 7.41 (t, J= 7.3 Hz, 1H, CH
(Ar)), 7.48 (s, 1H, CH (Ar)), 7.52 (t, J= 7.7 Hz, 1H, CH (Ar)), 7.60 (m,
8H, 8 CH (Ar)), 7.81 (d, J= 7.9 Hz, 1H, CH (Ar)), 8.50 (d, J= 5.0 Hz, 4H,
CH (Ar)); δC (400 MHz, (CD3)2SO) 51.7, 59.1, 79.1, 122.1, 122.4, 127.3,
128.0, 129.2, 130.4, 130.9, 131.4, 136.5, 138.6, 140.3, 141.2, 148.8,
159.2, 168.5, 206.4; HRMS (ES+) calculated for C40H39N6O2 [M+H] 635.3155.
Found 635.3129; IR (KBr, cm-1) 3441, 3060, 3008, 2921, 2849, 1719, 1637,
1592, 1569, 1473, 1432, 1364, 1290, 1250, 1125, 1095, 1067, 1047, 994,
763.
