$DATUM tert-Butyl
4-{[4-(prop-2-yn-1-yloxy)-2-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl]methyl}piperazine-1-carboxylate
(19). Sodium triacetoxyborohydride (2.63 g, 12.39 mmol) was added to a
solution of 4-(prop-2-yn-1-yloxy)-2-(trifluoromethyl)benzaldehyde 20
(2.57 g, 11.26 mmol) and tert-butyl-piperazine-1-carboxylate (2.1 g,
11.26 mmol) in 1,2-dichloroethane (25 mL) at room temperature. The
mixture was stirred at room temperature for 24 h and was poured into
water and solid K2CO3. The organic layer was extracted with EtOAc, dried
(MgSO4) and evaporated in vacuo. The residue (5.12 g) was purified by
chromatography (irregular SiOH 35-40 μm 80 g, 10-50% EtOAc in heptane).
The title compound (4 g, 89%). 1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d 6) 7.67 (1 H, d,
J=8.51 Hz), 7.20-7.30 (2H, m), 4.89 (2H, d, J=2.21 Hz), 3.62 (1H, t,
J=2.21 Hz), 3.54 (2H, s), 3.31 (4H, m), 2.30-2.32 (4H, m), 1.39 (9H, s).
