$DATUM Potassium
5-(((1R,2S)-2,3-Dihydro-2-hydroxy-1H-inden-1-ylamino)methyl)furan-2-yl-trifluoroborate.
To a test tube containing 5-formylfuran-2-yltrifluoroborate (61 mg, 0.30
mmol) in MeOH (3 mL) was added (1R,2S)-(+)-cis-1-amino-2-indanol (45
mg,0.3 mmol) with stirring at room temperature for 2 h. To this solution
was added pyridineborane (27 mg, 0.3 mmol) and stirring was continued 16
h. the solvent was then removed and the resulting white solid was
extracted with acetone (10 mL) using a Soxhlet extractor. To the acetone
solution was then added MeOH (2 mL) and KHF2 (94 mg, 1.21mmol). After
stirring for 2 hours the solvent was removed in vacuo and the resulting
white solid was extracted with 10% MeOH/acetone (3 x 5 mL). This solution
was concentrated and then precipitated with ether (10 mL) to give
Potassium
5-(((1R,2S)-2,3-Dihydro-2-hydroxy-1H-inden-1-ylamino)methyl)furan-2-yl-trifluoroborate,
yield 70 mg, 86%. Mp: greater than 200 °C.; [α]22D -2.0 ° (c = 4.3,
acetone); IR (KBr) = 2918, 2249 cm-1; 1H NMR (500 MHz, acetone-d6): δ
1.20 (s, 1H), 2.07 - 2.04 (m, 1H), 2.89 (dd, J = 17, 3 Hz, 2H), 3.09 (s,
1H), 4.02 (s, 1H), 4.31 (s, 1H), 4.48 (s, 1H), 6.05 (s, 1H), 6.15 (s,
1H), 7.04 - 7.24 (m, 4H); 13C NMR (125.8 MHz, acetone-d6): δ 39.4, 44.7,
65.2, 71.4, 108.6, 111.6, 124.9, 125.1, 126.2, 127.3, 141.0, 143.4,
153.0; 19F NMR (471 MHz, acetone-d6): δ -142.1; 11B NMR (128 MHz,
acetone-d6): δ 1.40; HRMS (ESI): calcd for C14H14BF3NO2 [M-K]- 296.1070,
found 296.1075.
